  "description": "Relocation of main entrance from side elevation to front; single storey side extension (Demolition of detached garage)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;&quot;&gt;The proposed development by reason of the absence of a\r\nsatisfactory FRA, fails to adequately evidence the mitigation methods to prevent flooding on the site, which is subject to a fluvial Flood zone 2 and high surface water flooding. As such, the development is considered to exacerbate the risk of flooding within the site and increase the risk and consequences of flooding to adjacent sites contrary to Policy SI 12 of the London Plan\r\n(2021), Policies DM9\r\nand DM10 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;font face=&quot;Corbel Light, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
